#
# Energy Efficient Ethernet off on every wired port. systemd 257 (Debian 13,
# the Pi deck host) ignores the .link drop-in's [EnergyEfficientEthernet]
# section, and EEE on a small PoE switch made ptp4l fault ("timed out while
# polling for tx timestamp"), so the deck sent nothing (2026-10-30).
# A NIC without EEE makes ethtool fail; udev logs that and carries on.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="net", KERNEL=="eth*|en*", RUN+="/usr/sbin/ethtool --set-eee $name eee off"
